OL,3,AAnother man admits raping woman drugged
OL,4,Aby husband over 20 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FBrougham, from Northwich, was told by a
OL,7,Fjudge at Manchester Minshull Street
OL,8,FCrown Court that he "should be under no
OL,9,Fillusion his sentence will be custody
OL,10,Fand a long time in custody."
